{
 "_source": "Linder et al., Nature Genetics 2025 (Borzoi), doi 10.1038/s41588-024-02053-6. Values are the EXECUTED OUTPUTS of the authors' own benchmark notebooks in github.com/calico/borzoi-paper, analysis/crispr/{flowfish,gasperini}/bench_{flowfish,gasperini}.ipynb, which is what Fig 4c,d / ED Fig 5a,b / Supp Fig 7a plot. Not digitised, not transcribed.",
