 "_intersection_rule": "bench_*.ipynb `intersect_or_beyond(borzoi, enformer, distance_within=98000)`: within 98 kb a pair must be scoreable by BOTH models to be counted; beyond 98 kb each model keeps its own. So bins 1-3 are a common pair set.",
